[49m  [1mFix:[0m [38;5;153mcache.runtime_dir = "~/s/.kache"[39m in [38;5;153mhosts/hm-shared/home.nix[39m. That's the same physical directory, so locks, events and the store stay where    [48;5;235m
[49m  they are, and cache keys don't change. I rebuilt the system and confirmed that a daemon started from the config alone, without the env override,    [48;5;235m
[49m  runs. Committed as [38;5;153m033a2083[39m.                                                                                                                        [48;5;235m
